      "name": "SetPositionalBias",
      "signature": "dword SetPositionalBias(dword dwValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Sets the positional bias value to the registry and global variable.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store input value in ECX (fastcall parameter)\n2. Write value to registry under Diablo II key with \"Positional Bias\" setting\n3. Store value in global g_dwPositionalBias variable\n4. Return the value in EAX\n\nParameters:\n- dwValue (dword): Positional bias value to set\n\nReturns:\n- dword: The input dwValue (passthrough)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
