      "name": "InitializeGameObjectState",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameObjectState(uint * pObject, uint dwFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Initializes game object state with flags and configurations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Create state array based on flag bit 0\n2. Calculate state value mask and offset based on flag bit 1\n3. Obtain vtable pointer and call virtual method at offset 0xc\n4. If operation fails (EAX < 0), return 0\n5. If flag bit 1 set, invoke virtual method on param at offset 0 (dereference)\n6. If successful, process object at offset 3 with virtual method calls\n7. Set object fields: [1]=dwMask, [0xd]=dwFlags, [2]=dwMask>>1, [0xc]=0xffffffff\n8. Return 1 on success, 0 on failure\n\nParameters:\n- pObject: Pointer to game object structure to initialize\n- dwFlags: Configuration flags (bit 0: mode, bit 1: process vtable)\n\nReturns:\n1 on successful initialization, 0 on error or failed operation",
