      "name": "InitSoundSample",
      "signature": "void InitSoundSample(int * pSample)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Initializes or resets a sound sample structure by clearing fields and calling initialization routines.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input sample pointer is not null\n2. Check sample stream state and assert on invalid conditions\n3. Enter critical section to ensure thread-safe access\n4. Get sound engine context to determine initialization path\n5. If no context, call cleanup routines and clear sample fields\n6. If context exists, only reset specific work fields\n7. Call sample vtable methods (0x34, 0x40, 0x3c, etc.) with parameters\n8. Handle special processing flags (bytes 0xd) to select different initialization modes\n9. Set audio properties based on global flags and apply volume scaling\n10. Leave critical section and return\n\nParameters:\n- pSample (int*): Pointer to sample structure containing vtable pointers and state fields\n\nReturns:\nvoid",
