      "name": "GetAudioStreamPositionInSamples",
      "signature": "dword GetAudioStreamPositionInSamples(void * pAudioStream)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Gets the current audio stream playback position in samples.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate the audio stream pointer is not NULL (FogAssert if NULL)\n2. Enter critical section to safely access shared audio state\n3. Check if stream handle exists in structure at offset 0x48\n4. Call GetAudioStreamPosition to retrieve current byte position and sample count\n5. Leave critical section\n6. Return position divided by 4 to convert bytes to samples, or 0 if stream invalid\n\nParameters:\n- pAudioStream (void*): Audio stream structure containing handle at offset +0x48\n\nReturns:\n- Current playback position in samples (position >> 2), or 0 if stream NULL or invalid\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x48: Offset of audio stream handle within stream structure\n- 0x304: FogAssert line number in source code\n- 2: Right shift amount to convert bytes to samples (equivalent to divide by 4)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
