      "name": "ShutdownAudioGameObjectStream",
      "signature": "void ShutdownAudioGameObjectStream(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Shuts down the global audio game object stream if active.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load g_pAudioGameObject pointer\n2. If NULL, return immediately (no active audio object)\n3. Reset g_dwSoundQueueTime to 0\n4. Call IsStateValid to verify audio object state\n5. If state invalid, return without closing\n6. Tail-call CloseSoundStream to close the audio stream\n\nParameters:\n  None - operates on global g_pAudioGameObject\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Early exit if g_pAudioGameObject is NULL\n  - Early exit if IsStateValid returns 0 (invalid state)\n  - Uses tail-call optimization for CloseSoundStream\n\nGlobal Variables:\n  g_pAudioGameObject (0x6f9f3d10) - Pointer to active audio game object\n  g_dwSoundQueueTime (0x6f9f3d14) - Sound queue timestamp, reset to 0\n\nCalled Functions:\n  IsStateValid (0x6f9e4550) - Validates audio object state\n  CloseSoundStream (0x6f9e3fa0) - Closes and cleans up audio stream\n\nClassification: Cleanup/Destructor - tears down audio stream state",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:843747d827513cf5ee226e608a14a107",
