      "signature": "void ProcessAudioQueue(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Processes audio queue by validating state and queuing sound buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_pAudioGameObject is initialized (non-NULL)\n2. Reset g_dwLastSoundQueueTime to 0\n3. Validate audio object state via IsStateValid()\n4. If valid, queue sound buffer with 200ms duration\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: g_pAudioGameObject - audio game object pointer\n- IMPLICIT: g_dwLastSoundQueueTime - queue timestamp tracker\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xc8 (200): Sound buffer duration in milliseconds",
