      "name": "AllocLinkedListNode",
      "signature": "void AllocLinkedListNode(void * * ppNode, dword dwValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Allocates and initializes a linked-list node, inserting it at head of chain.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 8 bytes (2 dwords) via FogMemAlloc\n2. Zero-initialize both dword fields\n3. Load original *ppNode value into second field (prev/next pointer)\n4. Store dwValue parameter into first field (data)\n5. Update *ppNode to point to newly allocated node (insert at head)\n\nParameters:\n- ppNode (void**): Address of node pointer; receives address of new node\n- dwValue (dword): Value to store in first field of new node\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8: Allocation size (2 dwords, 8 bytes)\n- 0xd4: Source line number for allocation tracking",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
