      "comment": "Validates that a file handle is valid and readable.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if file handle (nFileHandle) is non-zero\n2. Get file size for the handle\n3. If size is 0, attempt to read file data\n4. Assert on validation failure and terminate with error code\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (void*): Context pointer (unused in validation)\n- nFileHandle (int): File handle to validate\n\nReturns:\n- void (terminates process on failure via assertion)",
