      "comment": "Initializes memory range tracking structures with predefined bounds.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_6f9e7c17 with context pointer and memory range constants\n2. Set up tracking for lower memory region (0x10000)\n3. Set up tracking for upper memory region (0x30000)\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (void*): Context pointer passed from caller (implicit from ECX register)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10000 (65536): Lower memory bound\n- 0x30000 (196608): Upper memory bound",
