      "name": "IsMemoryLimitExceeded",
      "signature": "dword IsMemoryLimitExceeded(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Checks if memory usage limit exceeded.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate modulo remainder of total size by stride value\n2. Compare remainder against limit threshold\n3. Return 1 if remainder exceeds limit, 0 otherwise\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: DAT_6f9ee190 contains limit threshold\n- IMPLICIT: DAT_6f9ee298 contains total memory size\n- IMPLICIT: DAT_6f9ee2a0 contains stride/allocation unit size\n\nReturns:\n- 1 (true) if memory limit exceeded\n- 0 (false) if within limit",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
