      "name": "CleanupThreadLocalStorage",
      "signature": "void CleanupThreadLocalStorage(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Cleans up thread-local storage and critical sections on manager shutdown.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call CleanupCriticalSections to clean up synchronization objects\n2. Check if TLS slot is valid (g_dwTlsSlot != 0xFFFFFFFF)\n3. Free TLS slot via TlsFree and reset to 0xFFFFFFFF\n\nParameters:\n- (void) - No parameters\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeThreadLocalStorage: Allocates TLS slot\n- ManagerHandleInit: Calls this during shutdown (nState=0)",
