      "name": "FpuSwapAndDiscardST0",
      "signature": "void FpuSwapAndDiscardST0(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "FPU stack cleanup helper that swaps ST0/ST1 and discards the original ST0.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. FXCH - Exchange ST0 and ST1 (ST1 becomes new ST0)\n2. FSTP ST0 - Store and pop ST0 (discards top, promoting original ST1)\n3. Return with cleaned FPU stack\n\nParameters:\nIMPLICIT: ST0 - Value to discard\nIMPLICIT: ST1 - Value to preserve and return in ST0\n\nReturns:\nIMPLICIT: ST0 - Original ST1 value after stack cleanup\n\nCaller Context:\n- Called from Exp2F64 after FSCALE operation to clean up FPU stack\n- FSCALE leaves both result and scale factor on stack; this discards scale\n\nFunction Classification: Leaf helper function for FPU stack management",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:2efd2f634b43779c5726887ddad8796b",
