      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Wrapper to setup FPU parameters and invoke mathematical operation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store parameters 1-8 into local stack variables\n2. Copy FPU ST0 register to double local variable\n3. Call FUN_6f9e985b with param_2, local_24 pointer, and param_3\n4. Return original FPU value (float10)\n\nParameters:\n- dwParam1: Parameter 1 (first fastcall register ECX)\n- dwParam2: Parameter 2 (second fastcall register EDX)\n- wParam3: Parameter 3 (16-bit value)\n- dwParam4-dwParam8: Additional parameters\n\nReturns:\n- float10 value from FPU ST0 register\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6f9e985b: Called with params and local_24 address\n- Log2F64: Caller (xref at 0x6f9e5bc2)\n- FUN_6f9e6d39: Caller (xref at 0x6f9e6d7e)",
