      "name": "InitializeManager",
      "signature": "void InitializeManager(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes manager by parsing command line arguments and allocating argument array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if manager is already initialized\n2. Get module filename from GetModuleFileNameA\n3. Use command line if provided, otherwise use module filename\n4. First call to ParseCommandLineArguments counts arguments and calculates size\n5. Allocate buffer for argument array and strings\n6. Second call to ParseCommandLineArguments populates the array\n7. Store parsed arguments and count in global variables\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: Uses g_fManagerInitialized, g_pCommandLine globals\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x104 (260): MAX_PATH buffer size\n- 4: Size per argument pointer in array",
