      "name": "InitializeHeapManager",
      "signature": "int InitializeHeapManager(int nFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes the heap management subsystem with version detection.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Creates a heap handle with specified flags\n2. Determines heap version/configuration (2 or 3)\n3. Allocates version-specific buffer structures\n4. Validates buffer allocation succeeded\n5. Cleans up on failure\n\nParameters:\n- nFlags (int): Heap creation flags (0 = default, non-0 = HEAP_NO_SERIALIZE)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success (heap and buffer initialized)\n- 0 on failure (heap creation or buffer allocation failed)",
