      "name": "ModifyFPUControlWord",
      "signature": "dword ModifyFPUControlWord(void * this, void * pThis, dword nMask, dword nValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "comment": "Modifies FPU control word bits using mask and value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save current FPU control word via FSTCW\n2. Get current FPU control word state\n3. Clear bits indicated by nMask, then set bits from nValue\n4. Restore modified FPU control word via FLDCW\n\nParameters:\n- pThis (void*): This pointer (ECX register)\n- nMask (dword): Bits to clear in FPU control word\n- nValue (dword): Bits to set in FPU control word\n\nReturns:\n- dword: The modified FPU control word value",
