      "name": "ValidateCharacterForTransformation",
      "signature": "dword ValidateCharacterForTransformation(dword nCharCode)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Validates character code and applies encoding transformation if required.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if global encoding mode (DAT_6f9f3f3c) is disabled\n2. If disabled, check if character is in range 0x40-0x5B ('@' to '[')\n   - If in range, return character + 0x20 (lowercase offset)\n3. If mode enabled, acquire synchronization mutex if needed\n4. Call FUN_6f9e7e2c for character transformation with synchronization\n5. Release synchronization resources\n\nParameters:\n- nCharCode (dword): Character code to validate (typically ASCII value)\n\nReturns:\n- dword: Transformed character code or original code\n\nRelated: ProcessStringCharacters (caller), FUN_6f9e7e2c (transformation helper)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:4b965c6b568965e3ac70ee94d9ada740",
