      "name": "ClearBitsFromArray",
      "signature": "dword ClearBitsFromArray(dword * pdwBitArray, dword nBitIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Clears bits from a bit array starting at specified index.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate bit position within first dword (0x1f - (index % 0x20))\n2. If bit is set and next bit is unset, call processing function\n3. Clear bits from current and subsequent dwords\n4. Zero-fill remaining dwords in array\n\nParameters:\n- pdwBitArray (dword*): Base pointer to bit array (96-bit = 3 dwords)\n- nBitIndex (int): Starting bit index to clear\n\nReturns:\n- Result from processing function, or 0 if bit already clear",
