      "comment": "Copies a 12-byte block (3 dwords) from source to destination at specified offset.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate destination address as (nDestOffset + pdwSrc)\n2. Loop 3 times, reading each dword from pdwSrc\n3. Write dword to calculated destination, increment source pointer\n\nParameters:\n- nDestOffset (int): Offset from pdwSrc to destination address\n- pdwSrc (uint*): Source pointer, dereferenced to read data\n\nReturns:\n- void",
