      "name": "InitializeZeroBuffer12",
      "signature": "void InitializeZeroBuffer12(dword * pdwData)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Zeros 3 consecutive dword values (12 bytes total).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store XOR EAX,EAX to clear EAX register\n2. Set EDI = pdwData (first dword pointer)\n3. Execute STOSD 3 times to zero each dword\n4. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- pdwData (dword*): Pointer to 12-byte buffer (3 dwords)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNotes:\nUses efficient STOSD instruction sequence for bulk memory clearing.",
