      "name": "RotateBitsRight",
      "signature": "void RotateBitsRight(dword * pdwBits, dword nShiftAmount)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Rotate bits right across multiple uint array elements with carry propagation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Divide shift amount by 32 to get quotient (array stride) and remainder (bit shift)\n2. Process each uint in array, shifting bits right and accumulating carry from previous element\n3. Build carry word by taking displaced bits from each element\n4. Propagate carry word into next element\n5. Handle array tail elements after shift count offset\n\nParameters:\n- pdwBits (dword*): Pointer to uint array to rotate in-place\n- nShiftAmount (dword): Number of bits to rotate (0-31, higher bits determine array stride)\n\nReturns:\n- void (modifies array in place)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
