      "name": "FloatManipulateAndShift",
      "signature": "float10 FloatManipulateAndShift(float10 * __return_storage_ptr__, double dValue, short nShift)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Manipulates floating-point mantissa and shifts exponent bits.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load input double value from stack\n2. Add 0x3fe to nShift parameter (bias adjustment)\n3. Shift result left by 4 bits to align as exponent bits\n4. Mask off low bits from dValue mantissa (0x800f mask)\n5. Combine shifted exponent with masked mantissa using OR\n6. Reconstruct double from combined bits\n7. Return as float10 extended precision\n\nParameters:\n- dValue (double): Input floating-point value\n- nShift (short): Exponent adjustment value\n\nReturns:\n- float10: Result with modified exponent and masked mantissa bits",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:96ef86ea161c5c47c2f79058ef6d533b",
