      "name": "InitializeCharClassData",
      "signature": "void InitializeCharClassData(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes character class table and related global state to zero.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save EDI register by pushing to stack\n2. Load counter 0x40 (64 dwords = 256 bytes) into ECX\n3. Clear EAX register\n4. Set EDI to base of character class table at g_abCharClassTable (0x6f9f41e0)\n5. Fill 64 dwords using STOSD (repeat store)\n6. Store final byte using STOSB\n7. Zero EAX again\n8. Write 0 to multiple global state variables (dwCharClassTableState, dwCharClassTableIndex, etc.)\n9. Restore EDI from stack and return\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:05d3556ba26e52c51954a1255d97c525",
