      "name": "InitializeCharacterClassManager",
      "signature": "void InitializeCharacterClassManager(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Lazy-initializes the character class table on first call.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if manager is initialized (g_fManagerInitialized)\n2. If not initialized, call InitializeCharClassTable with error code 0xfffffffd\n3. Set initialization flag to prevent re-initialization\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNotes:\n- Called during manager startup (InitializeManager, ManagerStateInit)\n- Uses static initialization flag to ensure one-time execution\n- Error code 0xfffffffd indicates initialization context",
