      "name": "InitializeHeapManagerV3",
      "signature": "dword InitializeHeapManagerV3(dword nMaxSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes the V3 heap manager with a fixed 320-byte (0x140) buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 320-byte buffer from process heap via HeapAlloc\n2. Return 0 (failure) if allocation fails\n3. Initialize heap counters and pointers to 0\n4. Store max heap size parameter\n5. Set minimum heap size to 0x10 (16 bytes)\n6. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- nMaxSize (dword): Maximum heap size in bytes\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on successful initialization, 0 if HeapAlloc fails",
