      "name": "InvokeMemoryRecoveryCallback",
      "signature": "int InvokeMemoryRecoveryCallback(uint dwSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Invokes registered memory recovery callback to attempt memory recovery during allocation failure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if memory recovery callback (DAT_6f9f3f0c) is registered\n2. Call callback with requested size\n3. Return 1 if callback succeeds (non-zero), 0 if fails or not registered\n\nParameters:\n- dwSize: Size of memory to recover (bytes)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if recovery succeeded, 0 otherwise",
