      "signature": "int FindStringLength(char * szString, int nMaxLen)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Count characters in a string up to a maximum length.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Loop through characters in string while counter > 0\n2. Break if null terminator found\n3. Return length if null found, else return remaining count\n\nParameters:\n- szString (char*): String to measure\n- nMaxLen (int): Maximum characters to count\n\nReturns:\n- Length of string if null terminator found within nMaxLen\n- Remaining count if null not found",
