      "name": "AddUint32WithOverflowCheck",
      "signature": "bool AddUint32WithOverflowCheck(dword nAddend1, dword nAddend2, dword * pdwResult)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Adds two 32-bit unsigned integers and detects overflow.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Add nAddend1 and nAddend2\n2. Check if result < nAddend1 (overflow occurred)\n3. Check if result < nAddend2 (secondary overflow check)\n4. Set overflow flag if either condition is true\n5. Store sum to pdwResult and return overflow flag\n\nParameters:\n- nAddend1 (dword): First addend\n- nAddend2 (dword): Second addend\n- pdwResult (dword*): Pointer to store the sum\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if overflow detected, 0 if no overflow",
