      "name": "SetFPUControlWordBits",
      "signature": "short SetFPUControlWordBits(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Modifies and restores FPU control word bits for exception handling.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save current FPU control word with FSTCW\n2. Apply bitmask operations to set/clear control bits\n3. Load modified control word with FLDCW\n4. Return original control word as signed short\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: Stack frame for temporary storage\n\nReturns:\n- Original FPU control word as signed short value\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- FSTCW/FLDCW: FPU control word save/restore instructions\n- 0x4: Local variable offset for control word storage\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ProcessParameterType: Caller that invokes for type cleanup",
