      "name": "ConvertCharacter",
      "signature": "dword ConvertCharacter(dword nChar)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Converts a character to lowercase within character table mode or returns unchanged.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if character table mode is disabled (g_dwCharTableMode == 0)\n2. If disabled and character is in range [0x61-0x7A] (a-z), subtract 0x20\n3. If enabled:\n   - Increment reference count (g_dwCharTableRefCount)\n   - Check if table is protected (g_fCharTableProtected)\n   - If protected: acquire mutex, decrement count, call character conversion\n   - If not protected: call conversion directly, then decrement count\n   - Release critical section if mutex was acquired\n4. Return converted character or original value\n\nParameters:\n- nChar (dword): Character code to convert\n\nReturns:\n- Converted character code (lowercase conversion or original)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:e038b71e990839fd36df244ad8c1a314",
