      "comment": "Adjusts 96-bit mantissa value for rounding in floating-point formatting.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract exponent and mantissa fields from input parameters\n2. Check for underflow/overflow conditions based on exponent values\n3. Perform long multiplication and accumulation on 96-bit mantissa\n4. Apply left/right shifts to normalize mantissa based on exponent adjust\n5. Detect rounding boundary (0x8000) and propagate carries upward\n\nParameters:\n- pdwResult (dword*): Ptr to result mantissa (3 dwords: 96-bit value)\n- pdwAdjust (dword*): Ptr to adjustment parameters for exponent\n\nReturns:\n- void (modifies pdwResult in-place)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x7fff: Exponent mask (15-bit significant exponent)\n- 0x8000: Sign bit / rounding boundary threshold\n- 0x3fc0: Minimum valid exponent range\n- 0xbffe: Maximum valid exponent sum\n- 0xc002: Exponent bias adjustment constant",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
